<title>USA: Autocam to begin paying qtly cash payout.</title>
<headline>Autocam to begin paying qtly cash payout.</headline>
<dateline>KENTWOOD, Mich. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Autocam Corp said on Thursday that it will begin paying a quarterly cash dividend of $0.02 a share, and declared an annual five percent common stock dividend.</p>
<p>Both dividends will be paid November 28 to shareholders of record November 12.</p>
</text>
